    teacher: "Some learners may not be familiar with Isaiah; give brief background. Keep theology clear and worshipful. Avoid arguments about the identity of the Servant in Isaiah; present the Christian reading with respect for other views. Emphasise application.",
    assess: "Weekly check: ask learners to summarise Christ's path in Philippians 2.",
    mcq1: ["What does Philippians 2:5 say?", ["Have this mind among yourselves, which is yours in Christ Jesus", "Have your own mind", "Avoid Christ's mind", "Have no mind"], 0, "The mind of Christ."],
    mcq2: ["What will the Servant not do according to Isaiah 42:3?", ["Break a bruised reed", "Heal the sick", "Bring justice", "Speak"], 0, "He will not break a bruised reed."],
