    sa: ["What does the Servant of the Lord teach about leadership?", ["gentle", "justice", "emptied", "obedient", "exalted", "mind of christ"], "A good answer says the Servant brings justice gently, Christ emptied himself, took the form of a servant and became obedient to death, God exalted him, and believers are to share his mind."],
