    mcq1: ["What does Mark 9:37 say?", ["Whoever receives one such child in my name receives me", "Ignore children", "Children are a distraction", "Children cannot know Jesus"], 0, "Receiving a child is receiving Jesus."],
    mcq2: ["What did Jesus say about the children in Mark 10:14?", ["Let the children come to me; do not hinder them", "Send them away", "They are too young", "Wait for later"], 0, "Do not hinder them."],
