    sa: ["What does Jesus teach about greatness through the child?", ["child", "humble", "welcome", "least", "receive", "kingdom"], "A good answer says Jesus set a child before the disciples to teach that true greatness is humility, that welcoming the least is welcoming him, and that leaders must protect and honour little ones."],
